  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia Country Research Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Fund has been set up to provide operationally relevant research support to country offices in South Asia. Studies will be commissioned on the basis of demand from FCDO country offices in Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Burma, India, Nepal and Pakistan and the context-specific evidence generated will inform the design of new programmes and improve implementation of ongoing programmes in these country offices. It is expected that the evidence generated by the programme will also be useful for other donors and the wider development community. Gender will be a key focus in the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
